app.long_description:
This is an enhanced fork of NeoGeoCDRX (NiuuS) for Nintendo Wii featuring:

. native 240p output and selectable video modes;
. CUE/BIN and CDDA support;
. CHD compressed file support;
. integrated CD player;
. 2-player support;
. USB/xinput controller support (partial);
. audio and video improvements;

Keep the Wii Alive!
